id: unkillable-majin-from-goop
name: Unkillable Majin: From Goop
type: instant
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
# Always Bouncing Back (5)'s, open while From Goop is held (its `allow`).
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  The 3rd effect of From Goop as an Instant Maneuver, still for 1 Action.
text: >
  (5)-[Passive]: The 3rd effect of Majin Regeneration and 3rd effect of From Goop becomes an Instant Maneuver, but you must still spend 1 Action to use the effect.
  –Maneuver Type: Instant Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –KP Cost: N/A (the 3rd effect's: 4(bT))
  –Effect: Use the 3rd effect of From Goop.

---

# Its Action paid here; the 3rd effect of From Goop used out of sequence - its 4(bT) Ki Points and once a Round as written.
[on used]
maneuverOutOfSequence(from-goop-third-effect);
